WEBVTT

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:05.040
Shugo, shugo!

00:00:05.180 --> 00:00:07.570
Start it off with a Doki! It's Shugo Chara time!

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:11.170
Oh, look at that! Tadase-kun and Ikuto are fighting!

00:00:11.190 --> 00:00:15.300
This is when our heroine, Amu-chan, makes her entrance.

00:00:15.330 --> 00:00:18.690
But what is this? It's different from before!

00:00:18.720 --> 00:00:20.210
Do you think this could be...

00:00:20.230 --> 00:00:21.720
A power-up?!

00:00:21.760 --> 00:00:22.750
Doki!

00:00:31.760 --> 00:00:33.410
Pyon Pyon

00:00:33.410 --> 00:00:34.570
Fumu Fumu

00:00:34.570 --> 00:00:35.480
Yeah! Yeah!

00:00:35.480 --> 00:00:37.080
Howa Howa

00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:38.280
Kira Kira

00:00:38.280 --> 00:00:39.210
Yeah! Yeah!

00:00:39.210 --> 00:00:41.970
What color is your egg?

00:00:41.970 --> 00:00:44.750
Yeah! Yeah! Yeah!

00:00:46.730 --> 00:00:49.790
Even if you say mean things,

00:00:50.260 --> 00:00:53.640
I know you really love me.

00:00:54.160 --> 00:00:57.310
Even if we fight a lot,

00:00:57.870 --> 00:01:00.980
it's just 'cause we're always together.

00:01:01.470 --> 00:01:04.040
Because you believe in me,

00:01:05.160 --> 00:01:07.800
I can do anything!

00:01:08.610 --> 00:01:14.100
And that's why I unlock my heart!

00:01:15.970 --> 00:01:19.810
The person you want to be; things you want to say.

00:01:19.810 --> 00:01:23.470
Important things; things that are true.

00:01:23.470 --> 00:01:27.180
Who you are; what you've yet to realize.

00:01:27.180 --> 00:01:30.830
Mysterious things; happy things.

00:01:30.830 --> 00:01:35.740
All of these things are inside your egg!

00:01:38.210 --> 00:01:39.880
Pyon Pyon

00:01:39.880 --> 00:01:41.030
Fumu Fumu

00:01:41.030 --> 00:01:41.970
Yeah! Yeah!

00:01:41.970 --> 00:01:43.520
Howa Howa

00:01:43.520 --> 00:01:44.730
Kira Kira

00:01:44.730 --> 00:01:45.680
Yeah! Yeah!

00:01:45.680 --> 00:01:48.420
What color is your egg?

00:01:48.420 --> 00:01:51.230
Yeah! Yeah! Yeah!

00:01:57.120 --> 00:01:59.310
Ikuto, Ikuto!

00:02:00.340 --> 00:02:02.520
Is this okay? What about school?

00:02:02.570 --> 00:02:05.230
I'm beat. You go in my place.

00:02:05.270 --> 00:02:07.030
Guess I'll have to-nya.

00:02:07.150 --> 00:02:09.760
Textbook, check! Hankie, check!

00:02:09.780 --> 00:02:11.920
Dried sardine snack, yup, check!

00:02:12.030 --> 00:02:13.920
Hold it. Not!

00:02:20.460 --> 00:02:25.470
Episode 53
Totally Super Busy!?

00:02:27.840 --> 00:02:31.670
I'm sure everyone finds Easter's movements lately to be rather curi-

00:02:31.700 --> 00:02:34.310
Hey, aren't these donuts tasty?

00:02:34.360 --> 00:02:35.920
They're incredibly delicious.

00:02:35.970 --> 00:02:37.430
The cocoa is also excellent.

00:02:37.700 --> 00:02:41.410
The shop that sells them is so popular, I had to wait in line for an hour just to buy them!

00:02:41.460 --> 00:02:44.330
Huh? Wait in line? Just to buy some donuts? {translator note: This is not an exaggeration. I've seen 2 hour lines at the Shibuya Kripsy Kreme.}

00:02:44.370 --> 00:02:45.390
But of course!

00:02:45.420 --> 00:02:47.890
Girls go nuts over them! They're called...

00:02:47.930 --> 00:02:49.370
King Donuts!

00:02:49.440 --> 00:02:52.520
What? A suitable name for a king such as myself.

00:02:54.500 --> 00:02:55.770
Magnificent!

00:02:55.960 --> 00:02:58.400
This taste is like fine art.

00:02:58.440 --> 00:03:01.470
I wonder how they make them so delicious.

00:03:03.510 --> 00:03:04.980
Super yummy!

00:03:05.030 --> 00:03:06.310
For sure!

00:03:06.620 --> 00:03:09.390
Come on, you guys, don't just eat donuts.

00:03:09.460 --> 00:03:12.140
Now now, why don't you try one?

00:03:14.610 --> 00:03:16.710
Oh wow, they really are good!

00:03:16.800 --> 00:03:19.760
See? That one's vanilla-flavored, your favorite.

00:03:19.790 --> 00:03:21.010
Hinamori-san.

00:03:21.040 --> 00:03:24.150
Ah, such a nice mood with these two, as usual.

00:03:33.580 --> 00:03:34.880
What are you doing?

00:03:34.910 --> 00:03:36.860
I am eating a donut.

00:03:37.200 --> 00:03:42.720
I couldn't help it! I was just about to buy them when the Director called me back here!

00:03:42.720 --> 00:03:46.500
And? What did the Director want?

00:03:46.550 --> 00:03:50.310
He ordered me to devise a new plan to capture the Embryo.

00:03:50.600 --> 00:03:51.860
Sheesh.

00:03:51.900 --> 00:03:53.720
He works us much too hard.

00:03:54.940 --> 00:03:59.430
First, Nikaidou was dispatched to Seiyo Academy as a teacher...

00:04:02.240 --> 00:04:04.210
Oh, it was just you, Himamori-san.

00:04:04.240 --> 00:04:05.520
It's Hinamori!

00:04:05.610 --> 00:04:09.470
It just makes you smile, watching how hard everyone's trying.

00:04:11.280 --> 00:04:14.590
Their dream is to represent Japan in an international tournament, or something like that.

00:04:14.870 --> 00:04:16.680
But it's impossible, of course.

00:04:17.250 --> 00:04:23.380
I mean, if you look at the probabilities, there're only a handful of people who can fulfill their dreams.

00:04:23.440 --> 00:04:24.970
If you look at it realistically, that is.

00:04:40.370 --> 00:04:43.470
Hello, Hinamori Amu's Guardian Characters.

00:04:43.860 --> 00:04:45.680
Did you sleep well?

00:04:47.010 --> 00:04:51.680
I gave up on my worthless dreams. I'm going to be a winner. {I'm not entirely sure on these two}

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:02.060
Wait!

00:05:02.560 --> 00:05:04.350
Hello, Himamori-san.

00:05:04.600 --> 00:05:06.230
Amu-chan!

00:05:06.530 --> 00:05:07.530
Su!

00:05:08.320 --> 00:05:11.810
Sorry, but could you stand farther back as you observe?

00:05:16.910 --> 00:05:19.840
Remake Honey!

00:05:29.060 --> 00:05:31.280
They're all turning back to normal!

00:05:31.560 --> 00:05:34.060
The X Eggs are being cleansed!

00:05:34.590 --> 00:05:36.720
I thought I'd lost it. {Not sure on this one, but these are scenes from episode 23}

00:05:39.490 --> 00:05:41.870
I'm glad we can finally meet!

00:05:42.600 --> 00:05:45.430
You're my Guardian Character?

00:05:45.430 --> 00:05:48.400
Uh-huh. But I have to go now.

00:05:49.580 --> 00:05:51.520
Good-bye. See you again.

00:05:56.000 --> 00:06:00.010
My Embryo creation plan has failed, even after expending all those resources. It's a total screw-up.

00:06:00.080 --> 00:06:02.300
There's no denying that I'm a loser now.

00:06:02.570 --> 00:06:05.680
Loser? Who were you competing with?

00:06:06.560 --> 00:06:08.050
That would be...

00:06:08.370 --> 00:06:10.810
Society as a whole, I guess?

00:06:11.350 --> 00:06:12.770
You can't remember?

00:06:13.030 --> 00:06:15.270
Then it couldn't have been much of an opponent.

00:06:17.600 --> 00:06:21.470
The next strategy involved Hoshina Utau.

00:06:28.400 --> 00:06:31.590
Open your shiny eyes in the silent night.

00:06:31.630 --> 00:06:34.930
Swooping down on this mysterious eve,

00:06:34.930 --> 00:06:38.300
sneaking up close without making a footstep,

00:06:38.350 --> 00:06:41.430
the black cat makes a seductive pose.

00:06:41.820 --> 00:06:42.830
Ikuto!

00:06:44.820 --> 00:06:47.530
I'll grant your wish.

00:06:48.100 --> 00:06:51.850
I wouldn't use cheap tricks on a fledgling like you.

00:06:51.850 --> 00:06:54.810
Ikuto's issues have nothing to do with you!

00:06:55.080 --> 00:06:58.310
I won't lose... I won't lose to someone like you!

00:06:58.310 --> 00:07:04.560
The time has come for good children to sleep.

00:07:06.970 --> 00:07:13.810
Don't stare at me, don't capture me.

00:07:13.810 --> 00:07:20.510
I'm a butterfly that's lost her way.

00:07:20.940 --> 00:07:25.600
Eventually, we began the project's second stage: the Black Diamond Plan!

00:07:25.620 --> 00:07:29.010
We dispatched Yukari-senpai's little brother as a spy!

00:07:29.370 --> 00:07:31.900
Using a special method on the master CD at the L.A. studio,

00:07:32.030 --> 00:07:35.430
we'll absorb a large number of X Eggs.

00:07:36.090 --> 00:07:39.740
From now on, just by hearing Utau's song, whether through television, the internet,

00:07:39.850 --> 00:07:43.890
or cell phones, a heart's egg can be extracted.

00:07:43.890 --> 00:07:52.270
So what do you desire? What do you seek?

00:07:52.320 --> 00:08:03.390
The brilliance collected in the palm of that hand will scoop it up into the tainted night sky.

00:08:03.390 --> 00:08:09.980
Dark diamond, black diamond.

00:08:06.780 --> 00:08:09.690
Why do I sing?

00:08:10.410 --> 00:08:13.100
Is it for Ikuto? No...

00:08:13.740 --> 00:08:16.430
In the beginning, way back then,

00:08:16.760 --> 00:08:18.560
singing was just fun.

00:08:19.620 --> 00:08:21.710
But now...

00:08:24.290 --> 00:08:26.970
Utau, we came to talk.

00:08:27.650 --> 00:08:28.820
The real Utau's-

00:08:28.840 --> 00:08:30.640
Oh, what do <i>you</i> know?

00:08:31.910 --> 00:08:33.660
How could someone who does everything halfway, like you,

00:08:34.260 --> 00:08:36.860
possibly understand my suffering and sadness?

00:08:37.100 --> 00:08:39.030
Well, do you, Hinamori Amu?

00:08:45.710 --> 00:08:47.940
Character Transformation: Amulet Diamond!

00:08:49.240 --> 00:08:52.480
I've lost to Amu.

00:08:53.130 --> 00:08:54.140
No!

00:08:55.150 --> 00:08:56.910
You still have your songs, Utau.

00:08:57.220 --> 00:08:58.440
That's right!

00:08:58.650 --> 00:09:01.260
You have your wonderful songs.

00:09:10.200 --> 00:09:11.320
Sanjo-san!

00:09:12.620 --> 00:09:13.640
El.

00:09:14.570 --> 00:09:15.720
Lend me your power.

00:09:16.080 --> 00:09:17.140
Of course!

00:09:18.040 --> 00:09:20.550
Angel Cradle!

00:09:40.490 --> 00:09:43.450
And for all our troubles, we still failed.

00:09:43.500 --> 00:09:46.180
Yukari-senpai even left Easter.

00:09:46.180 --> 00:09:48.740
Yukari-senpai!

00:09:48.760 --> 00:09:50.780
Y-You're still after her?

00:09:51.100 --> 00:09:53.350
Hey, I got them!

00:09:53.550 --> 00:09:54.790
Donuts?

00:09:54.830 --> 00:09:57.250
No, fried bean buns I bought in Paris!

00:09:59.930 --> 00:10:03.010
What the heck were you doing all the way out in Paris?

00:10:03.360 --> 00:10:06.030
It was an order from the Director pertaining to the Embryo.

00:10:06.120 --> 00:10:08.780
Won't that just end up in failure, too?

00:10:09.250 --> 00:10:12.220
You might say that, but our plan...

00:10:12.220 --> 00:10:13.830
Done!

00:10:14.110 --> 00:10:16.690
We've finally completed the Embryon!

00:10:16.680 --> 00:10:18.180
Indeed, we did!

00:10:21.640 --> 00:10:24.310
What's going on? That's not in their programming!

00:10:28.850 --> 00:10:32.840
Golden Victory Shoot!

00:10:36.980 --> 00:10:39.010
Open Heart!

00:10:47.520 --> 00:10:50.410
We used up our entire stock of X Eggs.

00:10:50.520 --> 00:10:57.940
But thanks to that plan, we learned that the power of science cannot restrain X Eggs.

00:10:57.960 --> 00:11:02.750
That's right! Even if we didn't accomplish the Director's goal, we still ended up with a great result!

00:11:02.780 --> 00:11:03.780
Right, right!

00:11:04.930 --> 00:11:05.920
You bet!

00:11:05.970 --> 00:11:09.040
Easter's very foundation relies on their science team!

00:11:09.060 --> 00:11:10.190
Exactly!

00:11:09.090 --> 00:11:12.640
Long Live the Chief

00:11:09.700 --> 00:11:12.640
Viva Science Team!

00:11:10.220 --> 00:11:11.120
That's our Chief!

00:11:11.160 --> 00:11:13.230
Aw, go on!

00:11:15.020 --> 00:11:16.180
What are you doing?

00:11:18.020 --> 00:11:18.890
Chairman's Office

00:11:19.740 --> 00:11:22.460
Please, help yourself.

00:11:22.500 --> 00:11:24.490
Uh, no, I'm good.

00:11:25.300 --> 00:11:26.510
We're having a donut boom?

00:11:28.210 --> 00:11:30.320
Ah, I know this book!

00:11:30.560 --> 00:11:32.680
The Heart's Egg!

00:11:34.460 --> 00:11:38.640
Every child has an egg within their soul.

00:11:39.120 --> 00:11:44.320
This heart's egg cannot be seen with one's eyes. But as the child grows up, it vanishes.

00:11:44.720 --> 00:11:47.630
I wish we knew what came after that.

00:11:47.690 --> 00:11:51.430
Oh, speaking of which, this book's author is...

00:11:51.660 --> 00:11:55.430
Hey, Mr. Caretaker, what comes next in the story?

00:11:55.430 --> 00:11:56.900
Well you see...

00:12:01.170 --> 00:12:02.560
W-What happens?

00:12:02.630 --> 00:12:09.800
He said the egg powers-up and is reborn, and then goes on to defeat the seven demon lords! {I think the disappeared is implied, considering what they've already read in the story.}

00:12:09.850 --> 00:12:11.370
That has to be wrong.

00:12:11.400 --> 00:12:12.510
Definitely.

00:12:14.130 --> 00:12:15.040
Um...

00:12:16.320 --> 00:12:19.470
Why have you called me here?

00:12:19.890 --> 00:12:23.990
My apologies. This is your first time here, correct?

00:12:24.090 --> 00:12:24.890
Yes.

00:12:25.090 --> 00:12:29.990
Well then, there's something I have all first-timers do.

00:12:30.440 --> 00:12:31.750
Pick a card.

00:12:35.330 --> 00:12:36.850
Joker.

00:12:37.080 --> 00:12:38.320
I see.

00:12:38.980 --> 00:12:41.520
What does it mean?

00:12:43.230 --> 00:12:46.030
A small star, brightly shining.

00:12:46.150 --> 00:12:50.580
That light will radiate out, piercing the darkness,

00:12:51.120 --> 00:12:53.430
drawing in other stars which have lost their way.

00:12:53.960 --> 00:12:55.650
Huh?

00:12:57.470 --> 00:13:02.390
A new tale is about to commence. The Humpty Lock must sense it as well.

00:13:02.780 --> 00:13:03.910
The lock?

00:13:08.170 --> 00:13:10.430
It doesn't look any different, though.

00:13:10.900 --> 00:13:14.760
It's difficult to detect the changes in yourself.

00:13:15.110 --> 00:13:19.610
But those who are always watching you should notice.

00:13:24.240 --> 00:13:26.580
It looks like it's starting to rain.

00:13:32.070 --> 00:13:34.080
Yup, it's raining-nya.

00:13:41.850 --> 00:13:44.950
I don't think it's going to let up anytime soon.

00:13:46.930 --> 00:13:48.200
That park...

00:13:51.510 --> 00:13:52.340
Ikuto.

00:13:52.890 --> 00:13:53.750
What?

00:14:16.460 --> 00:14:19.640
Man, I'm soaked thanks to you.

00:14:19.680 --> 00:14:21.930
Well, you shouldn't have scared me like that.

00:14:22.360 --> 00:14:24.350
It serves you right.

00:14:24.970 --> 00:14:26.990
The rain isn't stopping-nya.

00:14:27.030 --> 00:14:29.530
But don't you enjoy a good rain once in a while?

00:14:29.570 --> 00:14:30.740
What's good about it?

00:14:30.770 --> 00:14:35.240
When the rain falls, it has this sort of melancholic feeling, you know?

00:14:35.470 --> 00:14:37.460
Marengo? Rick? {Marengo is the name of a town in Illinois }

00:14:37.600 --> 00:14:38.470
What the heck is that?

00:14:39.140 --> 00:14:41.810
It's a very feminine, romantic feeling. {otome-tikku is nearly impossible to translate in one word}

00:14:41.810 --> 00:14:44.640
Sighing as you look at the rain...

00:14:44.680 --> 00:14:46.470
Crying as you look at the moon...

00:14:46.470 --> 00:14:48.060
I don't get it-nya.

00:14:48.110 --> 00:14:51.490
You get wet in the rain, then you catch a cold.

00:14:51.710 --> 00:14:53.200
There's nothing good about it-nya.

00:14:55.190 --> 00:14:56.260
Excuse me.

00:15:01.200 --> 00:15:03.330
Here is the report on this month's activities.

00:15:03.460 --> 00:15:04.720
Excellent work.

00:15:05.250 --> 00:15:07.350
Um, where's Hinamori-san?

00:15:08.640 --> 00:15:13.800
I tried to stop her, but she insisted on trying to get home before it really started to pour.

00:15:21.400 --> 00:15:22.350
What is it?

00:15:22.390 --> 00:15:23.680
N-Nothing.

00:15:24.670 --> 00:15:27.180
Something's different about you.

00:15:28.710 --> 00:15:32.830
Really? Maybe I <i>have</i> grown a little taller.

00:15:32.920 --> 00:15:35.430
Dummy. That's not what I mean.

00:15:39.120 --> 00:15:42.760
It's difficult to detect the changes in yourself.

00:15:43.260 --> 00:15:47.710
But those who are always watching you should notice.

00:15:48.510 --> 00:15:55.030
Has Ikuto been... But he's the holder of the Dumpty Key. We should be enemies.

00:15:59.710 --> 00:16:01.640
So you're Amu?

00:16:01.970 --> 00:16:03.270
It's fine.

00:16:03.680 --> 00:16:06.720
I'm not the type who makes desserts in the first place.

00:16:07.400 --> 00:16:11.300
This is better than the shame I'd feel over giving him something that sucked.

00:16:12.090 --> 00:16:14.530
So really, nothing's wrong.

00:16:16.760 --> 00:16:18.080
Why are you even here?

00:16:18.060 --> 00:16:21.970
Oh, the Humpty Lock. You're going to try to steal it again!

00:16:22.060 --> 00:16:23.280
Nope.

00:16:24.170 --> 00:16:27.200
We're giving this to you as repayment. {There're a lot of snacks! }

00:16:28.330 --> 00:16:29.900
There are so many snacks!

00:16:29.900 --> 00:16:31.760
It's like the stuff you'd have at your grandmother's house.

00:16:42.140 --> 00:16:44.200
What are you going to do with that egg?

00:16:45.470 --> 00:16:49.090
Tell me! Were you the one who turned them into X Eggs?

00:16:51.350 --> 00:16:52.310
Did you?!

00:16:53.590 --> 00:16:55.270
I hate you!

00:16:56.050 --> 00:16:57.140
I hate you! {Go!}

00:17:04.230 --> 00:17:05.580
What are you doing-nya?

00:17:05.610 --> 00:17:08.210
Hurry up and destroy the X Eggs-nya!

00:17:08.230 --> 00:17:09.120
Shut up.

00:17:09.780 --> 00:17:13.540
We used to all come to this amusement park together.

00:17:14.080 --> 00:17:18.860
But it'll be gone soon. It'll end.

00:17:19.390 --> 00:17:24.280
The time for worrying about which ride to choose is coming to an end.

00:17:24.600 --> 00:17:26.640
Amu, I'll be the one to take that!

00:17:29.790 --> 00:17:31.740
What does Ikuto wish for?

00:17:32.400 --> 00:17:35.680
What does he want?

00:17:38.770 --> 00:17:40.440
Hey, where's your violin?

00:17:40.520 --> 00:17:42.920
I leave it at home on days like today.

00:17:43.170 --> 00:17:46.240
The tone will change with just a small shift in humidity.

00:17:46.750 --> 00:17:47.850
I see.

00:17:48.610 --> 00:17:51.240
Is that violin something important to you?

00:17:51.560 --> 00:17:54.170
Oh? Are you interested?

00:17:54.350 --> 00:17:55.490
About me.

00:17:55.470 --> 00:17:57.760
Huh?! You wish!

00:17:59.290 --> 00:18:01.580
You're such an easy tease.

00:18:03.970 --> 00:18:06.010
She's being completely toyed with.

00:18:06.040 --> 00:18:08.910
Whatever happened to Ms. Cool & Spicy?

00:18:08.940 --> 00:18:10.640
Oh me, oh my.

00:18:11.980 --> 00:18:13.260
Hinamori-san!

00:18:13.900 --> 00:18:14.930
Tadase-kun!

00:18:16.250 --> 00:18:18.530
Long time no see, Tadase.

00:18:19.950 --> 00:18:21.060
Tsukiyomi Ikuto!

00:18:25.480 --> 00:18:27.930
You came all the way here with an extra umbrella?

00:18:28.260 --> 00:18:31.380
Tadase is just doing his duty as the King.

00:18:31.830 --> 00:18:35.760
The King takes great pains to prevent his subjects from becoming rain-soaked.

00:18:35.970 --> 00:18:38.680
Still playing king, I see.

00:18:38.940 --> 00:18:40.700
Grow up a little, will you?

00:18:41.930 --> 00:18:47.970
The little king who lost the key is not fit to open the lock.

